# run.sh builds into a `mktemp -d` (examples/mandelbrot/run.sh:10), so nothing
# lands here from the gate. These catch the manual form the README does not use
# but a reader will reach for: `./tychoc examples/mandelbrot/main.ty -o
# examples/mandelbrot/main` (binary), and the same with `--emit-c` (main.c).
# (expected.out is un-ignored in the root .gitignore, like the other goldens.)
/main
/main.c
